Day 4 08:02  MEDIUM  Phone calls from the website dried up
             Gus asked why nobody rings from the site any more. Mobile visitors, 71
             percent of traffic, saw no phone number above the fold.
             Calls from the site down by about 60 percent in the first month.

Day 8 18:45  MEDIUM  Enquiries silently lost for nine days
             The sending domain's DNS record lapsed and Resend rejected every message. The
             function returned 200 and the form said thanks each time.
             About 23 enquiries lost, including two emergency callouts that went to a
             competitor.

Day 12 16:28  LOW  Replies went to a no-reply address for a month
             A later tidy-up renamed replyTo to reply_to, which the SDK ignores. Gus's
             replies went to website@. The one test that covered reply-to asserted
             nothing.
             Around 30 customer replies sent into an inbox nobody reads.

